TYPES: #eg-0305 organization, sportsorganization, team

PRE-MARKUP:

Example of a fictional team or organization.

MICRODATA:

HTML
<div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Organization">
  <h1 itemprop="name">Fictional Team</h1>
  <meta itemprop="alternateName" content="fictionalteam">

  <img itemprop="logo" src="https://exemplo.com.br/logo.png" alt="Fictional Team Logo">

  <span itemprop="location">Location Name</span>

  <div itemprop="member" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Person">
    <span itemprop="name">Member One</span>
  </div>

  <div itemprop="member" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Person">
    <span itemprop="name">Member Two</span>
  </div>

  <div itemprop="member" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Person">
    <span itemprop="name">Member Three</span>
  </div>
</div>


RDFA:

HTML
<div vocab="https://schema.org/" typeof="Organization">
  <h1 property="name">Fictional Team</h1>
  <meta property="alternateName" content="fictionalteam">

  <img property="logo" src="https://exemplo.com.br/logo.png" alt="Fictional Team Logo">

  <span property="location">Location Name</span>

  <div property="member" typeof="Person">
    <span property="name">Member One</span>
  </div>

  <div property="member" typeof="Person">
    <span property="name">Member Two</span>
  </div>

  <div property="member" typeof="Person">
    <span property="name">Member Three</span>
  </div>
</div>


JSON:

